parts.text:
Display the original linked generated_pixel_art prominently in a simple Hollowtide World Asset Forge review page. Use the actual image URL unchanged, CSS image-rendering: pixelated, contain fit, no cropping, smoothing, filters, recoloring, added glow or grain over the art. Show Asset Brief and small labeled reference thumbnails below. State Candidate — review before Godot import. Do not claim transparency, exact exported resolution, rigging or engine readiness. Flat magenta can remain visible. Read MODE in Asset Brief: PROP/PROP SET have margins; TILESET/WATER have edge-to-edge cells and no gutters. For TILESET show only the intended row-major legend from the brief/production prompt, clearly as intended rather than verified automatic extraction; no new generated images. Offer an Open original link using the real generated image URL. Only offer a download link if it points to that actual original image; no invented buttons, links or file types. Keep UI quiet and readable; no scans, image hover glows or technical decorations.

